    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Aura of Angry Crystals",
      "category": "defensive",
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "divine",
        "visual"
      ],
      "text": "60 feet. Any creature that ends its turn in the aura while in possession of any crystals, gemstones, or other precious stones must attempt a DC 39 Fortitude save save.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected and is immune to the aura for 1 hour.\n\nSuccess The creature is unaffected.\n\nFailure The creature's crystals reverberate with Ulressia's vengeful aura, sharpening at every corner and digging, as if powerfully magnetized, into the creature's flesh.\n\nThe creature takes 4d6 piercing damage, plus 5 void damage for every 2,000 gp the crystals are cumulatively worth (maximum 40 damage).\n\nThe creature can't discard the crystals until they leave the aura or roll a successful save against it.\n\nCritical Failure As failure, but 8d6 piercing damage, plus 10 void damage for every 2,000 gp of the crystals' value (maximum 80 damage).\n\n---\n\nUlressia can deactivate or activate this aura using a single action, which has the concentrate trait.",
      "rules": [
        {
          "key": "aura",
          "slug": "aura-of-angry-crystals",
          "radius": 60,
          "traits": [
            "divine",
            "visual"
          ],
          "when": [
            "aura-of-angry-crystals-active"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "roll-option",
          "option": "aura-of-angry-crystals-active",
          "toggleable": true,
          "default": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Crystallize Blood",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "text": "Ulressia channels her warped powers over crystals through her blade and into a creature's body, partially crystallizing its blood.\n\nUlressia makes a melee dagger Strike. On a hit, the creature takes damage as normal and must also roll a DC 41 Fortitude save save.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature is Drained 1.\n\nFailure The creature is Drained 1, plus Slowed 1 for 1 round.\n\nCritical Failure The creature is Drained 2, plus Slowed 1 for 1d4 rounds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Stunning Strike",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements Ulressia hit a foe earlier this turn with a weapon Strike\n\n---\n\nEffect Ulressia makes a weapon Strike against the foe. On a success, the foe must succeed at a DC 41 Fortitude save save or become Stunned 1. On a critical failure, the foe is Stunned 2 instead."
    }
